            <title>System-evolution</title>
            <link>https://olboi7.github.io/fantastic-waffle/p/system-evolution/</link>
            <pubDate>Thu, 11 Jun 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <guid>https://olboi7.github.io/fantastic-waffle/p/system-evolution/</guid>
            <description>&lt;img src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/img/top_Evo.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Featured image of post System-evolution&#34; /&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;low-pressure-system&#34;&gt;Low pressure system&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Aquarium pump was working 24/7 that system made to mush noise &amp;hellip; I removed it 2 days after I had installed it&amp;hellip;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;aa&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/fantastic-waffle/img/zero.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;no-pressure-at-all-kratky-&#34;&gt;No pressure at all Kratky !&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;I did&amp;rsquo;n wand to waste my crops so I try Kratky method. I put the plant in water and as the plants grow the water level drop, so that the roots can access air.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;aa&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/fantastic-waffle/img/Kraker1.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;pressurized-system&#34;&gt;Pressurized system&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;I bought a high pressur tanks a pump and a lot of parts to built my 1st high pressur prototype.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;aa&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/fantastic-waffle/img/sys_0.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;I installed it, but it was too noisy&amp;hellip; I had to find a solution.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;aa&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/fantastic-waffle/img/boite_iso_0.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;I buit a sound insolated box to put my water tank and my punp in it and &amp;hellip;.. it works ! finally I could sleep!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;aa&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/fantastic-waffle/img/boite_iso1.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;aa&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/fantastic-waffle/img/boite_iso2.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Whit my pump and my water tank removed I could add a microgreens shelf!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;aa&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/fantastic-waffle/img/sys_1_overall.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;i-want-more&#34;&gt;I want more!&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;aa&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/fantastic-waffle/img/Tarts.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;my-system-now-for-the-moment-&#34;&gt;my system now&amp;hellip;&amp;hellip; for the moment !&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full automated system with interface user. In this one I added 2 more powerfull LED lights to be able to grow fruit!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;aa&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/fantastic-waffle/img/sys_3.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;</description>
